data/
storage/jobs/*
!storage/jobs/.gitkeep
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
# .git/ used to be excluded here. Now shipped deliberately so Jarvis can
# commit/push a website change from inside the running container (see
# app/deploy_utils.py) -- checked git history first, confirmed no secrets
# were ever committed to a file (all API keys/tokens go through the
# encrypted Settings store at runtime, never into a tracked file).
